  worldCategories:
  - categoryName: Hubs
    environments:
    - worldName: Campfire
      worldKey: Campfire
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: A nighttime forest environment with tall pine trees, a central
        campfire, and a few tents. Logs are placed around the fire for seating. Ambient
        sound include fire crackling. The area is calm and designed for quiet exploration
        or relaxation.
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aacbc7c8f94f6a74092d14246ad4a8e5, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
    - worldName: Ocean Villa
      worldKey: Ocean Villa
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: 'A modern oceanfront villa with glass walls, open to the
        sea breeze. The environment includes palm trees, wooden floors, an infinity
        pool, and minimalist indoor spaces. '
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: be96b4c00f375bf478889b601850b20c, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
    - worldName: Games
      worldKey: Games
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: A futuristic gaming environment with soft ambient lighting
        and smooth metallic surfaces. Floating UI panels respond to hand gestures.
        Users can interact with objects and levers to learn core XR mechanics. Teleportation
        zones are marked by pulsing lights. Dynamic lighting and a subtle background
        hum enhance the immersive, tech-focused environment.
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba956be2dc747c84cb5aa20a77ea3a87, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
  - categoryName: Geospatial
    environments:
    - worldName: Earth Terrain
      worldKey: Earth Terrain
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: This environment is built using real-world Earth terrain
        data.
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0068bbc61dbc44e46a5e683b43156547, type: 3}
      flyMode: 1
    - worldName: Moon Terrain
      worldKey: Moon Terrain
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: This environment is built using real-world Moon terrain data.
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d00d7b756bb37cd498b519c772cfd351, type: 3}
      flyMode: 1
  - categoryName: Other
    environments:
    - worldName: Dark Space
      worldKey: Dark Space
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: A geodome structure sits on a floating platform in deep space,
        illuminated by a soft spotlight. Its honeycomb design glows in amber and
        magenta tones. Cherry blossom trees bloom nearby, with petals suspended in
        still air. The surrounding environment is dark and minimal, creating a surreal,
        tranquil atmosphere. This scene is designed as a quiet, dreamlike sanctuary.
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9c9cb025d886ca24e9b0af1416589e5a, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
    - worldName: Bright Space
      worldKey: Bright Space
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: An open, futuristic environment with a mirrored ground and
        a large, flowing glass structure. Steel frames form a crystal-like lattice,
        and sunlight filters through, creating moving shadows. The space is minimal
        and uncluttered, with no walls, emphasizing clean lines and openness. Designed
        to feel peaceful and otherworldly, this environment showcases a balance of
        light, form, and architectural elegance.
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c6ad4fd66735ec7419f4f0a41284a0c0, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
    - worldName: Materials Examples
      worldKey: Materials Examples
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: "A clean, open space built to showcase surface materials.
        Spheres and cubes are arranged in rows, each displaying different textures
        and shaders \u2014 including metallic, matte, glass, and emissive types.
        Neutral floors and walls prevent color distortion, while directional lighting
        and reflection probes enhance realism. Users can walk or fly around to inspect
        materials from any angle. This environment functions as a visual catalog
        for material testing and presentation."
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1f7c26e3fa3c9234aac14ed5ca91b9da, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
    - worldName: Mixed Reality
      worldKey: Mixed Reality
      worldImagePath: 
      worldDescription: "A clean, open space built to showcase surface materials.
        Spheres and cubes are arranged in rows, each displaying different textures
        and shaders \u2014 including metallic, matte, glass, and emissive types.
        Neutral floors and walls prevent color distortion, while directional lighting
        and reflection probes enhance realism. Users can walk or fly around to inspect
        materials from any angle. This environment functions as a visual catalog
        for material testing and presentation."
      sceneProvider: 0
      worldImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70b38ab1fd2e8e844b5d4da8356e172f, type: 3}
      flyMode: 0
